        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">PHP</span>
          <span class="bg-red-100 text-red-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Laravel</span>
